Modifications in this repository include:
  - Migration from singer-python to the Meltano Singer SDK
  - Per-report incremental sync via state_param URL injection
  - Type-aware bookmark formatting (datetime, numeric, and string)
  - Per-report start_date / start_value configuration for incremental sync
  - Removal of Symon platform-specific error logging

